;; TODO: Overloading: at least multiple arities. Better would be overloading by
;; destructuring signature, but we'll need to be able to detect ambiguity and
;; have a deterministic selection. Julia's type matching is great, but it's a
;; sat solver under the hood which is why the compiler blows up sometimes on
;; bigger codebases, which is a hell of a downside.
